 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Not weird at all. Lots of people dress up a bit at home, especially if they have a nice background or a robe. Layers are your friend. A thin sweater over a vest over a T-shirt makes a great setup. Smart shoes with a good grip are worth the price. Want look professional without going for the full suit? A button down shirt and khakis are classic. Kind of. It gives the impression of office without being overpowering. A nice watch helps too. People make assumptions based on what you wear.",
